# Apex Vouchers — Build a Complete Admin SEO Manager

I want to add a complete **SEO Management System** to my existing custom Apex Vouchers website.

The website is NOT WordPress. It is a custom application with a frontend, backend, MongoDB, customer dashboard, voucher/product system, payment system, and Admin Panel.

I want the Admin Panel to provide SEO functionality similar to the useful parts of **Yoast SEO / Rank Math**, but built specifically for Apex Vouchers.

The admin must be able to edit product titles, descriptions, SEO titles, meta descriptions, URLs, keywords, images, and other SEO settings directly from the Admin Panel without editing code.

---

