# 10. SEO SCORE CATEGORIES

Calculate the score based on meaningful checks.

For example:

### Basic Metadata

* SEO title exists
* SEO title reasonable length
* Meta description exists
* Meta description reasonable length
* Canonical configured/generated

### Content

* Product description exists
* Description has useful depth
* H1 exists
* H2/H3 structure
* Focus keyword appears naturally
* Content is not extremely thin

### URL

* SEO-friendly slug
* No unnecessary query parameters
* Reasonable URL length
* Lowercase slug
* Hyphen-separated words

### Images

* Product image exists
* ALT text exists
* ALT text is descriptive
* Image size is reasonable where measurable

### Internal Links

* Product has relevant internal links
* Related voucher/product links
* Useful navigation

### Technical

* Page indexable
* Canonical URL
* HTTPS
* Mobile-friendly architecture
* Structured data where appropriate

Do not award points merely because a keyword is repeated many times.

